{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25413","headline":"遥伤茅山县孙尊师三首 一 · 李德裕","name":"遥伤茅山县孙尊师三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蝉蜕遗虚白，蜺飞入上清。\n同人悲劒解，旧友觉衣轻。\n黄鹄遥将举，斑麟俨未行。\n惟应鲍靓室，中夜识琴声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李德裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25413.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25413","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}